                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-6">
                            <div class="store-feature-card">
                                <i class="bi bi-shield-check text-gold"></i>
                                <h5 class="fw-bold text-white mt-2 mb-1">Free Valuation</h5>
                                <p class="text-white-50 small mb-0">
                                    Apni old jewellery free evaluate karwao
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-6">
                            <div class="store-feature-card">
                                <i class="bi bi-cup-hot text-gold"></i>
                                <h5 class="fw-bold text-white mt-2 mb-1">Comfort Lounge</h5>
